  "changes": [
    "Select dependency-closed algorithm definitions and resolve case-table constants from the original modules; remove CLI, file-manager, multiprocessing, and unrelated analysis imports.",
    "HogWriter.__init__ retains species-column, HOG-content, and comparable-node mappings but exposes header and rows instead of opening result files.",
    "HogWriter.WriteCachedHOGs and write_hog_genes collect (level, row) pairs in rows, sorting levels deterministically; the latter preserves its original matching N0.ids identifier.",
    "HogWriter.close_files is a no-op because the collector owns no files.",
    "Add module provenance/docstrings and a Python 3 xrange alias. No computational function bodies have been altered."
  ]
